  portraitImage: {fileID: 1289033131}
  isCrowQuestNPC: 0
  noCoinsDialogue:
  - 'Hello Kinjo! Why the long face? Your owner is bankrupt! '
  - He needs money, well lucky for you, I know about a treasure chest somehwere around
    here.
  - Ooh.. So you want to learn about the treasure, huh?
  - I may be able to help you, if you bring me three gold coins!
  someCoinsDialogue: []
  rewardDialogue:
  - Wow! You managed to actually find three gold coins!
  - 'Alright then, I don''t know where the treasure is exactly, but I do have this
    key for the treasure chest! '
  - I heard you needed to dig somewhere but I don't know where. And I can't dig anything
    myself.
  alreadyRewardedDialogue:
